{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "TOKYO OVERDRIVE",
    "steam_appid": 3382010,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382010/extras/b6790caf4e68714e2df9150cc385dc6d.avif?t=1733973231\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a powerful driving simulator-type QTE game that is experienced through realistic images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first-person view enhances the immersive experience, and the player must make full use of steering wheel and gas pedal controls to reach the checkpoints within the time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three types of courses are available, including Metropolitan Expressway and mountain passes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382010/extras/5b6fcaecb11f349b589f2caa809ca72c.avif?t=1733973231\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steering wheel operation: Left and right arrow keys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate: Spacebar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the steering wheel in the direction indicated by the arrow, and when the arrow disappears, step on the accelerator to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key is to quickly assess the situation ahead and drive efficiently to minimize time loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382010/extras/20f277534b78aa69b71e906e7928d47d.avif?t=1733973231\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reason for development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We started development with the idea of \u201ccreating a realistic driving game that I myself would really like to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are thoroughly focused on the immersive visuals, realistic car behavior, driving sounds, and background music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We designed a racing game set in Tokyo so that players can enjoy a driving experience in a virtual space that cannot be experienced in real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382010/extras/a3e6941ba06114563918de7219d0772c.avif?t=1733973231\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Course Addition: Mountain Pass Course</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new \u201cPass Course\u201d set in the suburbs of Tokyo has been added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new course is set in the suburbs of Tokyo and allows players to enjoy drifting from left to right, allowing them to fully demonstrate their driving techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382010/extras/2a8f267adaf1a5d9e489fe5a5e95dc55.avif?t=1733973231\" width=800 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Racing Image  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameover offers a wide variety of racing images for you to enjoy in each scene. The racing scenes, which allow you to fully enjoy the romance of men, will add a glamorous touch to the climax of the story.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382010/extras/b6790caf4e68714e2df9150cc385dc6d.avif?t=1733973231\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a powerful driving simulator-type QTE game that is experienced through realistic images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first-person view enhances the immersive experience, and the player must make full use of steering wheel and gas pedal controls to reach the checkpoints within the time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three types of courses are available, including Metropolitan Expressway and mountain passes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382010/extras/5b6fcaecb11f349b589f2caa809ca72c.avif?t=1733973231\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steering wheel operation: Left and right arrow keys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate: Spacebar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the steering wheel in the direction indicated by the arrow, and when the arrow disappears, step on the accelerator to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key is to quickly assess the situation ahead and drive efficiently to minimize time loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382010/extras/20f277534b78aa69b71e906e7928d47d.avif?t=1733973231\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reason for development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We started development with the idea of \u201ccreating a realistic driving game that I myself would really like to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are thoroughly focused on the immersive visuals, realistic car behavior, driving sounds, and background music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We designed a racing game set in Tokyo so that players can enjoy a driving experience in a virtual space that cannot be experienced in real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382010/extras/a3e6941ba06114563918de7219d0772c.avif?t=1733973231\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Course Addition: Mountain Pass Course</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new \u201cPass Course\u201d set in the suburbs of Tokyo has been added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new course is set in the suburbs of Tokyo and allows players to enjoy drifting from left to right, allowing them to fully demonstrate their driving techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382010/extras/2a8f267adaf1a5d9e489fe5a5e95dc55.avif?t=1733973231\" width=800 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Racing Image  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameover offers a wide variety of racing images for you to enjoy in each scene. The racing scenes, which allow you to fully enjoy the romance of men, will add a glamorous touch to the climax of the story.</p>",
